# Hunt of the Black Lion (Q333), the tablet run: a level 25 fighter on Sophya's fourth letter, who
# has heard Redfoot's gossip three times, holds 99 stakato talons, seven lion claws, nine lion eyes,
# two of each tablet fragment but the first, three fourth cargo boxes, eighty guild coins and 1000
# adena. A Marsh Stakato drone drops the hundredth talon and a fourth box (both rolls 0); Sophya
# pays 3500 adena and three claws, and trades ten claws, with no eye past the ninth, for four
# hundred soulshots (roll 30). Redfoot has no more gossip; he opens two boxes into the first tablet
# fragment (rolls 78 and 10, then 99 and 20, the even roll false both times). Rupio breaks the first
# tablet (even roll false) and assembles the second (true), Lockirin buys it for 30000 adena, and
# Morgan pays 300 adena for a box and no coin past the eightieth; Sophya then has nothing to pay for
# while a box is left. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
